            0.838,
            0.716,
            0.912
          ],
          "content": "Wacław Sierpiński (1882 – 1969) was a Polish mathematician known for his numerous contributions to mathematics, including the Sierpiński gasket, one of the earliest and most famous examples of a fractal."
